Z||000000||Joe Torma||11-05-2001||04:22 PM||||Now you too can add valuable horsepower and great looks to your car!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I just got my vinyl cutter and after a half an hour was playing with it.  Works great!<P>I've already got some projects that were waiting on the arrival on my machine...Skunk Stripe kit, Pegasus decals, Custom Guage Faces.<P>Anything you guys looking for?<BR>If you've drawn something, I can most likely reproduce it.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Ricers Welcome!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/simplesig1.gif">  <BR>Did you get your car in my book yet????<BR> <A HREF="http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm</A>||||reg||1
