Z||000012||Joe Torma||11-06-2001||10:32 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Screwie:<BR><B>Hey Joe, how's the book going anyway? Lot of pics/stories already?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>No...7.  Many people filled out the form, but no pics.  Only 1 with a writeup.  C'mon people!<P>I got a small 15" Roland Cutter.  I have printing service, but I've been wanting to do my own vinyl for a while.<P>There is some paintable vinyl I have to get a new vinyl book to see.  I have seen people follow the vinyl edge with paint.<P>I can get chrome, silver, holographic, reflective, translucent, shadow(cheap way to do ghost flames/fades), and more!  Most are glossy finishes.<P>Type R stickers are available in 4HP, 6HP and 24HP versions  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I'm most likely going to help with the Grassroots Fiero.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR> ||||reg||1
