Z||000016||Joe Torma||11-06-2001||01:51 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ChopTop:<BR><B>Joe, I should have asked before will you have static cling vinyl?<P>I have an idea based on the traditional Fiero icon.  I can send the design idea via fax if you can receive.  Thanks.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You can fax any ideas to 908-369-4628.  Note sizes and colors, and I'll figure out a price.  Actual artwork will need to be emailed/mailed.<P>Yes, I'm pretty sure I can get the static cling sheets to apply vinyl to.<P>Whatever you guys want!  I will probably put some standard stuff on my website for sale(Pegasus decals, windshield decals, etc).  <P>Hey if you've got a good design idea, I'll pay you for it.  ||||reg||1
