Z||000021||Joe Torma||11-20-2001||09:22 AM||||For now, and for you guys...<BR>$5.00 linear foot for the easy stuff like words, simple graphics.<BR>  So, the cutter can do 13.8" wide so fit what you can in that width by however many feet you need.<P>BUT...If you want like 100 Pegasus logos well, that's going to cost a bit more, because they take forever to do(intracate logo).<P>If you have a design, send me a b/w BMP image(at about 300dpi depending on the size), or a vector image and I can let you know how much is involved.  ||||reg||1
